            "summary": "<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Thousands of men and women are ditching prescription drugs and choosing natural solutions that work without the side effects. Here are the 5 proven methods they're using to block DHT, reduce shedding, and regrow thicker, healthier hair.</p>",
