    "cwc_listicle_image_text_mYbiJk": {
      "type": "CWC_listicle_image_text",
      "name": "Listicle Image Text",
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#111111",
        "pill_color": "#60a1a2",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 50,
        "image_position": true,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/natural_hair_support-2-min.png",
        "pill_text": "DHT Support",
        "title": "<h3>1️⃣ Block DHT at the Source with Saw Palmetto</h3>",
        "text": "<p>Saw Palmetto is a plant extract that naturally inhibits the enzyme responsible for converting testosterone into DHT. By blocking this conversion at the source, it protects your hair follicles from shrinking and allows them to produce thicker, healthier hair.</p>",
        "text_2": "<p>Clinical studies show Saw Palmetto can reduce DHT levels by up to 32%, making it one of the most effective natural alternatives to prescription blockers. Unlike finasteride, it doesn't come with the high risk of sexual side effects or hormonal disruption.</p>"
      }
    },
    "cwc_listicle_image_text_DQdfAB": {
      "type": "CWC_listicle_image_text",
      "name": "Listicle Image Text",
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#111111",
        "pill_color": "#60a1a2",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 50,
        "image_position": false,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/natural_hair_support-3-min.png",
        "pill_text": "Stronger Roots",
        "title": "<h3>2️⃣ Nourish Your Follicles with Stinging Nettle</h3>",
        "text": "<p>Stinging Nettle is a nutrient-dense herb that works in two ways: it helps block DHT and delivers essential vitamins and minerals directly to your hair follicles. Think of it as both a shield and a superfood for your scalp.</p>",
        "text_2": "<p>Rich in iron, magnesium, and Vitamin C, Stinging Nettle strengthens the hair shaft, reduces breakage, and improves blood circulation to the scalp. Better circulation means more oxygen and nutrients reaching your follicles, which translates to stronger, faster-growing hair.</p>"
      }
    },
    "cwc_listicle_image_text_Www933": {
      "type": "CWC_listicle_image_text",
      "name": "Listicle Image Text",
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#111111",
        "pill_color": "#60a1a2",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 50,
        "image_position": true,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/natural_hair_support-min_6b97019d-d592-4bbe-8c94-75865a9267cf.png",
        "pill_text": "Thicker Hair",
        "title": "<h3>3️⃣ Rebuild Hair Structure with Biotin</h3>",
        "text": "<p>Biotin (Vitamin B7) is the building block of keratin—the protein that makes up your hair. When your body has enough biotin, it can produce stronger, thicker hair that's less prone to breakage and shedding.</p><p><a href=\"/products/number-one-natural-dht-blocker\" title=\"Natural DHT Blocker\">See The NEW Way People Are Strengthening Hair Naturally</a></p>",
        "text_2": "<p>Biotin deficiency is surprisingly common, especially in men and women with high-stress lifestyles. Supplementing with biotin ensures your body has the raw materials it needs to build healthy hair from the inside out. Within 4-6 weeks, most men report noticeable improvements in hair texture and thickness.</p>"
      }
    },
    "cwc_listicle_image_text_gJVeBF": {
      "type": "CWC_listicle_image_text",
      "name": "Listicle Image Text",
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#111111",
        "pill_color": "#60a1a2",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 50,
        "image_position": false,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/natural_hair_support-4-min.png",
        "pill_text": "Healthy Scalp",
        "title": "<h3>4️⃣ Support Scalp Health with Zinc and Selenium</h3>",
        "text": "<p>Zinc and Selenium are trace minerals that play a crucial role in hair growth and scalp health. Zinc helps regulate oil production and supports the hair growth cycle, while Selenium protects follicles from oxidative stress and inflammation.</p><p><a href=\"/products/number-one-natural-dht-blocker\" title=\"Natural DHT Blocker\">See How These Minerals Support Stronger Growth</a></p>",
        "text_2": "<p>A healthy scalp is the foundation for healthy hair. When your scalp is inflamed or clogged, even the best DHT blockers can't do their job. Zinc and Selenium create the optimal environment for hair growth, ensuring your follicles stay open, nourished, and active.</p>"
      }
    },
    "cwc_listicle_image_text_MkQXDj": {
      "type": "CWC_listicle_image_text",
      "name": "Listicle Image Text",
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#ffffff",
