        "pill_text": "Maximum Results",
        "title": "<h3>5️⃣ Combine Them All in One Simple Daily Routine</h3>",
        "text": "<p>Each method works on its own — but they work even better together. Instead of buying multiple supplements, thousands of men and women use Simply Revival, a single formula that combines all 5 key ingredients (plus 5 more botanicals) into one daily capsule.</p><p><a href=\"/products/number-one-natural-dht-blocker\" title=\"Natural DHT Blocker\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">See the Simple Daily Routine Thousands Are Using </span></a></p>",
        "text_2": "<p>Simply Revival delivers the right doses in the right ratios — no guessing, no buying bottles separately. Men and women report less shedding, better texture, and visible improvements within just a few weeks</p>"
      }
    },
